Read-attribution probe (PANZER_READ_PROBE) -- kept out of every commit.

Re-add it with:
    git apply probe_read_attribution.patch
Remove it again with:
    git apply -R probe_read_attribution.patch

It prints [PROBE] / [PROBE-SCATTER] / [PROBE-HIST] / [PROBE-PATH] /
[PROBE-DSET] at process exit when PANZER_READ_PROBE=1, and the first n union
calls when PANZER_READ_PROBE_LOG=<n>. It is what priced to_improve.md point 31
(143990000 elements swept for 8000 wanted, 3.17 s of an 11.39 s get()).

